{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_bstalk_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bstalk_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"呼喚荒野","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bstalk_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"91f5b6a5baf836c79a8a6a6d04c6715cbf75565de1c095c0ffb6dfd6536dabbb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為了自己的創業之路，豆苗報名參加了一次比賽。但小磐蟹們帶回了令人恐懼且憤怒的消息，豆苗決定掀翻這裡，用來自荒野的力量。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥，你說我要不就乾脆回拓荒隊算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們豢養的羽獸確實會幫助咱們捕捕獵之類的，但和大城市裡面那些人喜好完全不符吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒試試怎麼就知道肯定不行呢？萬一他們就好這一口呢？你看那邊那個姑娘......她都能帶著一群磐蟹來參加，你慌什麼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我可是聽到了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心我讓豆豆咬你哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（假裝兇狠地揮舞鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎哎我錯啦——抱歉抱歉，只是想安慰安慰他，沒想到被你聽到了，對不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但說真的，姑娘，用兇猛羽獸做噱頭，確實能開闢一些全新的市場吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我也不是特別清楚呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就和你說的一樣，我都能帶著磐蟹來參加，羽獸算是更常見的寵物了，說不定就能成功哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，而且我剛剛突然有了一個主意，你們要不要聽聽看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要是想讓節目出彩的話，跟我合作怎麼樣？我借給你們幾隻最強壯的小磐蟹，它們可以配合你們的羽獸，表演一齣精彩的搏鬥大戲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這麼大方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，我來這裡的目的就是打出小磐蟹的名聲，讓更多人知道它們的厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要是在這裡打出了名聲，小磐蟹不是一樣跟著出名嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算失敗，它們也跟著你們學會了些新技能，哼哼，怎麼看我都不虧啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，太謝謝你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，等候的時間可長著呢，足夠和它們打好關係了，我來教你們吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回神了回神了！小傢伙們，我們已經到達等候區，要開始訓練啦，聽話的可以吃到高級餌食哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，有什麼不舒服的地方就先說出來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？它們會說話？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿盤&扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（動動左邊鉗子，敲敲腦袋）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，頭上的花不太舒服嗎？我看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錘頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原地轉圈，抬起爪爪）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腳被石頭劃傷了？啊——碎石居然卡在這裡了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做得很好哦錘頭，下次也要這樣直接說出來你不舒服的地方，不能學小冰全都自己忍著哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小冰","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（使勁跺腳）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最近也表現得很好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厲害吧？是“鉗鉗話”，這可是我們獨創的交流方式！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如這個（伸出右手晃晃）。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（向右轉圈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（做出喝水的姿勢）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搬來一瓶礦泉水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這樣啦！怎麼樣？除了這些日常的小指令，在我工作的地方，它們還能聽懂更多的命令，還可以參加一些高難度行動呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我這回準備的節目，就是在三分鐘內，展示出它們隨意變化的隊形和正確履行各類指令的能力，最後兩分鐘則是和評委們互動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓評委學會幾個新指令後試著指揮一下小磐蟹，但在我下令之前，小磐蟹們不會聽任何人的指令，這樣能更好地展示出它們的專業性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得我都有緊迫感了，皮特，咱們快回去好好練練自己的節目！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼！我這幾年可不是白幹的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看上哪個了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那個小姑娘，她帶了磐蟹來，很少見，也很特殊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"毛茸茸的小獸們已經佔據市場太久了，該有一些奇異的、少見的、衝擊人的寵物出現了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"增加幾個噱頭幾個標籤，價格就可以拔高不少。“完美溝通聽從你意見的利甲寵物”怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"在荒野中讓人懼怕的存在，如今開著小花可可愛愛地陪伴在你身邊，同時還能聽懂你的話服從你的指令，嗯嗯——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"豆苗小姐，您的名字很可愛呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問找我具體有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，這是我們的廣告合約，豆苗小姐可以先看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"您提交的履歷我們已經看了，在來之前，豆苗小姐不是有試圖發售“豆苗牌精緻寵物糧”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，主辦方覺得我做得如何？是不是還不錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，雖然取得了一定的成績......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"但還是太不夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"這個名字和它配套廣告的主題還不夠清晰，不夠極致，表達還不夠有衝擊力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"廣告台詞所包含的情感還不夠濃烈，正文的敘述不夠曲折，爆點的數量太少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一款新出售的商品，它的名字和廣告語都要響亮，要有特色，要直抓人心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"市面上已經出現的噱頭我們不要再重複，還沒有出現過的東西才是我們要的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"所以哪怕只是最細微的語調也不能夠太過平淡，要吸引人，要讓人燃起購買欲望！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來竟然是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"豆苗小姐，我們的審核分為很多種，有通過比賽晉級，有我們私下挖掘聯絡。您很幸運地屬於第二種——可以直接登上表演舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以為豆苗小姐提供更多的資源幫您打響名號，同時您也需要和我們合作拍一些宣傳的廣告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"豆苗小姐剛才一直在翻看我們的合約，覺得我的提議怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你的提議很打動我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼豆苗小姐，我給您詳細地確認一下合約的具體內容，比如說......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？經費這條的數字怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被你發——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"數字完全沒有變化呢！和我們最開始寫的一模一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，你人還不錯嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，算不上算不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，豆苗小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簽好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"合作愉快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼去了，弄得身上這麼臭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"噫......髒死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"還用說嗎？那群剛抓來的磐蟹多多少少有些不聽話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"最倔的幾個已經被處理掉了，嘁，弄到身上了。現在剩下的好歹能聽人的指令做事——我可必須要保證在演出結束後提供足夠多的貨源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"至於那個小姑娘自己帶來的，她看得太緊了，不過真的少了幾個，我想她也看不出來什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......不說了，我先去收拾一下自己，待會兒還要去找豆苗，好好誇誇她的小磐蟹呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（慌張地跑出來）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大力士？你怎麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不都在廠房裡好好休息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（把鉗子放在臉邊橫著比劃）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......你聞到了陌生同類的味道，但是是已經死去的同類？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（指向廠房的方向）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在廠房附近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廠房後面確實有一個小房子，但那個不是倉庫嗎？之前路過幾次，門上有鎖，裡面好像是箱子一類的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用鉗子指向自己）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說有別的磐蟹被關在裡面？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）大力士，等等，我們去一個沒有人的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了......我以為我好好地看住你們就不會出什麼事，沒想到他們居然去荒地裡抓野生磐蟹開始訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們居然還殺掉了不聽他們話的磐蟹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大力士，我們一定要把它們救出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"豆苗小姐，原來你在這裡，我找了半天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，嗯，請問有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"訓練的時間到了，結果豆苗小姐卻在這裡偷懶，我當然要來問問了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！對，是我忘記時間了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼哨）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這就開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，小傢伙們，聽我的指揮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二、一、二，排成初始隊列——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來按照之前的排練再走一遍流程——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有特殊的彩蛋動作——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"別偷懶哦，馬上就是正式演出了，你一直表現不錯，可不要關鍵時刻出錯。我先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）小傢伙們！我剛剛得知了一個大問題，大力士聞到了死去的陌生同伴的氣味，而且在工廠後的小倉庫裡，還關著很多野生磐蟹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）現在知道這件事的只有我們，所以我們接下來要改變訓練任務，排練出新的隊形，救出它們，並讓它們安全地離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）小傢伙們，就靠你們了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小磐蟹們","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摩鉗擦爪）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豆豆，這個隊形記住了嗎？你們一定要掛成一條，鉤住他們放在窗戶下的倉庫鑰匙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揮揮鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大力士，扭扭，你們清楚要做的任務了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天就是彩排，等那幾個穿黑衣服的人一上台，你們就鉗斷舞台的支撐柱，狠狠地摔他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士＆扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖搖小花）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！最重要的是一定記住，做任何事都要悄悄的，千萬不能被發現，你們自己的安全最重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙們，等事情結束以後我給你們開最好的餌食罐頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"不可能完成的任務之——磐蟹大作戰"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（悄悄地指揮）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（謹慎地攀爬）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（隊形成功！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（順著同伴的身體爬上了桌面勾到了鑰匙！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑰匙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（碰撞的響聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在自己被工作人員察覺之前一個華麗的轉身帶著鑰匙縮進牆面縫隙藏了起來！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（任務完成）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（和同伴們消失在陰影中只留下一些帥氣的背影）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦急地四處亂爬）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咔咔？（我們的任務不是這個吧？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦急地揮舞鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一番親身遭遇的哭訴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（更多的求助）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"！（原來隔壁樹洞裡走丟的孩子在那裡！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咔。（等等......你看起來有些眼熟。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咔咔？（你是不是之前住石頭縫裡大花家的兒子？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（短暫愣住後欣喜地旋轉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咔咔！！（兄弟姐妹們抄傢伙啊！我二舅他鄰居表妹的兒子遇上事了！！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豆豆，開門後麻煩你給野生磐蟹們傳遞我的意思，我不確定它們在經歷了這些事後有沒有對人類產生攻擊性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們現在跑出去肯定會被發現，我會把鎖眼堵死讓門鎖失效，只要它們在聽到舞台倒塌的聲音後，馬上衝出這裡跑到荒野上，就安全了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揮舞鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那，我開門了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是來救你們的，請相信我們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屋裡的磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（可憐巴巴地縮在一起）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——你們還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"來，我們彩排一下明天正式演出的流程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"節目名單已經發到了各位的手裡，話不多說，我們正式開始——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲呼哨）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士＆扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（了然地揮動鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士＆扭扭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（帶領其他磐蟹爬上了舞台架）"},{"type":"narration","text":"磐蟹們按照計畫開始潛入舞台的支撐區，豆苗在緊張地等待，舞台也開始發出吱呀的聲音。\n一切都如豆苗所計畫的。\n但在此時，一件豆苗意料之外的事情發生了。\n大力士和扭扭沒有停下，它們直直地爬上了舞台的最高層，並迎著風立起了自己的身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂？那是什麼情況！磐蟹怎麼跑到那邊去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"豆苗？管好你的磐蟹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯！"},{"type":"narration","text":"豆苗緊張地打出呼哨，詢問磐蟹們的舉動。\n大力士和扭扭轉過了身子，面向舞台背後的荒地。\n舞台也並沒有如豆苗所期待的在主辦方腳下坍塌，她腳下的地面反而開始震動起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（再次緊張地呼哨）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士＆扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（安撫地揮動鉗子）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，遠處的地平線上揚起了大片沙土，隨後，大地也開始劇烈地震動——\n數十隻，數百隻，或者是數千隻，數不清的大大小小的磐蟹驟然湧入這片區域，鉗子閃著鋒利的光。\n舞台最高處的磐蟹放下了高舉的鉗子，轉身示意舞台下的豆苗。\n瑞柏巴女孩了然，她突然跳上一旁空置的箱子，並向外面的荒地呼喊起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"豆苗？你發什麼瘋？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大力士＆扭扭","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（站在舞台最高處動作幅度很大地揮舞鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大力士！扭扭！告訴你們的夥伴們，給我狠狠地鉗他們的屁股——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它們是從哪裡來的啊啊啊啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——好多磐蟹！"},{"type":"narration","text":"磐蟹們極具目的性地衝向了舞台。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主辦方人員開始用腳踩，開始用手邊能拿到的一切東西驅趕這群生物，他或許打到了一隻兩隻，但更多的磐蟹湧了上來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一聲沉悶的聲響後，舞台在磐蟹的鉗子下轟然倒塌，揚起鋪天蓋地的灰塵。\n倉庫裡被關住的磐蟹也蜂擁而出，加入了這個隊伍。\n它們衝向主辦方，衝向掛滿了彩燈的舞台，甚至連帶著搜刮走了幾罐沒有吃完的高級餌食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"參賽者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃，別、別鉗我的腳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，不用害怕，小磐蟹們是來幫我們的！它們很溫馴，不會傷人的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，雖然野生的我不是很確定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"數量增多的渾水摸鱗磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（專心地吃高級餌食）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管了，先跑，先跑——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們逃出去再說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙們，你們也跟上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你們——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主辦方人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙們，呼......呼......有沒有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有受傷？舞台倒下來的時候，有沒有壓到哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有從倉庫裡逃出來的小傢伙們，你們怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（互相用鉗子交流）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（逐漸簇擁在豆苗身邊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......是想跟著我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野生磐蟹","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（晃晃鉗子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......我工作的地方在羅德島，我們一起去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"avg_452_bstalk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在路上，我給你們講講我們的日常吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":"avg_npc_605_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快樂地揮舞鉗子）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
